  "goodToKnow": "Ausspionieren means to spy on someone or something: Nachbarn, Firmen, Daten ausspionieren. In the GDR, the Stasi spied on a large part of the population; after 1990 people could read their own files. The 2013 revelation that the NSA had tapped Angela Merkel's phone caused outrage. Der Spion is a spy. Participle: ausspioniert."
